e_bus&amp;utm_content=zh\">Grand Central</a></td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><a href=\"https://ttklia.com/bus/lalaport-to-queen-street?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=kl_to_singapore_bus&amp;utm_content=zh\">Queen Street</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><a href=\"https://ttklia.com/bus/lalaport-to-grantral-complex?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=kl_to_singapore_bus&amp;utm_content=zh\">Grantral Complex</a></td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><a href=\"https://ttklia.com/bus/lalaport-to-resorts-world-sentosa?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=kl_to_singapore_bus&amp;utm_content=zh\">Resorts World Sentosa</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><a href=\"https://ttklia.com/bus/lalaport-to-harbourfront?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=kl_to_singapore_bus&amp;utm_content=zh\">HarbourFront</a></td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><a href=\"https://ttklia.com/bus/lalaport-to-tai-seng?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=kl_to_singapore_bus&amp;utm_content=zh\">Tai Seng</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><a href=\"https://ttklia.com/bus/lalaport-to-jurong-east?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=kl_to_singapore_bus&amp;utm_content=zh\">Jurong East</a></td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><a href=\"https://ttklia.com/bus/lalaport-to-tampines?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=kl_to_singapore_bus&amp;utm_content=zh\">Tampines</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><a href=\"https://ttklia.com/bus/lalaport-to-jurong-west-gate?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=kl_to_singapore_bus&amp;utm_content=zh\">Jurong West Gate</a></td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><a href=\"https://ttklia.com/bus/lalaport-to-the-plaza?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=kl_to_singapore_bus&amp;utm_content=zh\">The Plaza</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><a href=\"https://ttklia.com/bus/lalaport-to-katong-v?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=kl_to_singapore_bus&amp;utm_content=zh\">Katong V</a></td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\"><a href=\"https://ttklia.com/bus/lalaport-to-woodlands?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=kl_to_singapore_bus&amp;utm_content=zh\">Woodlands</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>每家巴士公司的下车地址各有不同，下车点也可能更改。付款前打开行程详情，在地图上把新加坡的具体街道地址和你的酒店对照一下。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "cta",
      "content": {
        "heading": "要去新加坡？在Lalaport上车",
        "subheading": "从Bukit Bintang的Lalaport交通枢纽开往Bugis及其他23个新加坡下车点的长途巴士。在ttklia.com选日期、时间和下车点。",
        "buttonText": "查看Lalaport到新加坡的巴士",
        "url": "https://ttklia.com/bus/lalaport-to-bugis?utm_source=teeko&utm_medium=blog&utm_campaign=kl_to_singapore_bus&utm_content=zh"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "付款前核对这几点"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<ul><li><strong>上车点。</strong>想在Bukit Bintang上车，就确认写的是Lalaport、LaLaport BBCC或Lalaport Transportation Hub。</li><li><strong>下车地址。</strong>光看下车点名称不够，要核对街道。</li><li><strong>出发时间。</strong>星期五、周末和学校假期，关卡排队会比较久，行程要留余地。</li><li><strong>结账总额。</strong>比较含手续费的最终价格，不要只看“起价”。</li><li><strong>车票上的名字。</strong>必须和护照一致。</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>把车票存在手机里。上车时要出示，过关时可能还要再出示一次。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "出发当天在Lalaport"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "image",
      "content": "{\"url\":\"https://bucket.teeko.ai/teeko-prod/blogs/2026/10/1792064706944-lalaport-hub-ticket-kiosks.jpg\",\"alt\":\"Lalaport交通枢纽巴士售票柜台旁的自助售票机\"}",
      "imageSize": "medium"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>枢纽在Lalaport BBCC东中庭LG1层。初次去请早点到。办理登车后，在休息室等到屏幕显示你的巴士。想先放下行李去吃饭？巴士车位附近有36个储物柜，24小时RM20到RM55（<a href=\"https://www.straitstimes.com/asia/se-asia/taking-the-coach-to-kl-heres-what-you-can-expect-at-the-new-lalaport-transport-hub\">The Straits Times</a>）。同一层有ATM和换钱柜台，出发前可以先换新加坡元。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "过关"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>巴士会停两次。先在马来西亚关卡办理出境，再到新加坡关卡，视路线是Woodlands或Tuas，办理入境和海关。每次下车都要带上护照、手机、车票和药物。下车前记下巴士的车牌号码和颜色，回来才找得到。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "SG Arrival Card"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>所有旅客抵达新加坡前，都必须提交SG Arrival Card和电子健康申报。经Woodlands或Tuas入境的新加坡公民、永久居民和长期准证持有人可以免交（<a href=\"https://www.ica.gov.sg/enter-transit-depart/entering-singapore/sg-arrival-card\">ICA</a>）。在抵达前3天内（包括抵达当天）通过ICA网站或MyICA app提交。提交是免费的，任何要收费代办的网站都别用。SG Arrival Card不是签证，你的护照需不需要签证也要查清楚。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "回吉隆坡"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>ttklia.com不卖新加坡到Lalaport的车票。回程请向巴士公司或订票网站预订，找吉隆坡下车点写着Lalaport的班次。<a href=\"/zh/blog/singapore-to-kl-bus\">新加坡到吉隆坡巴士指南</a>讲了这段行程，<a href=\"/zh/blog/mdac-malaysia\">MDAC指南</a>讲了马来西亚的入境卡。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "常见问题"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "吉隆坡到新加坡巴士从哪里出发？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>很多吉隆坡到新加坡巴士从Lalaport交通枢纽出发，枢纽在Bukit Bintang的Lalaport BBCC，就在Hang Tuah站旁边。也有些从Bandar Tasik Selatan的TBS出发。请看车票上的上车点。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "从Lalaport可以订到几个新加坡下车点？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>在ttklia.com可以订从Lalaport到24个新加坡下车点的巴士，从2nd Link到Woodlands。点进每个下车点，就能看到你那天有哪些巴士公司营运。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "搭巴士去新加坡需要SG Arrival Card吗？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>需要，除非你是经Woodlands或Tuas入境的新加坡公民、永久居民或长期准证持有人。抵达前3天内在ICA网站或MyICA app免费提交。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "可以在ttklia.com订新加坡到Lalaport的巴士吗？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>不行。ttklia.com卖Lalaport到新加坡的巴士，但不卖新加坡到Lalaport。回吉隆坡请向巴士公司或其他订票网站预订。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "上车前可以把行李放在Lalaport吗？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>可以。Lalaport枢纽的巴士车位附近有36个储物柜，24小时RM20到RM55，按大小收费，24小时内随时可以打开。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "总结"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>搭吉隆坡到新加坡巴士，如果你住在吉隆坡市中心，就到Lalaport交通枢纽上车。选离酒店最近的新加坡下车点，核对街道地址，出发前提交SG Arrival Card。然后<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/bus/lalaport-destinations?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=kl_to_singapore_bus&amp;utm_content=zh\">在ttklia.com预订Lalaport到新加坡的巴士</a>。</p>"
    }
  ]
}
